{"folder":null,"name":"Arc Projector","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/a/ac/ME2_HW_-_Arc_Projector.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Arc Projector fires a bolt of concentrated electromagnetic energy that ionizes the air between weapon and target, creating a conductive channel through which subsequent lightning arcs jump from enemy to enemy. A single shot can incapacitate an entire cluster of targets in rapid succession, bypassing their kinetic barriers entirely. Cerberus developed it for anti-Geth operations, where its chain lightning effect is most visible — and most lethal.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"arc-projector","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"arc-projector","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"bomb","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"electricity","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":30,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":5,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"68c1ae3e9de5510b"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Collector Assault Rifle","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/d/db/ME2_AR_-_Collector_Assault_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Collector Assault Rifle is a weapon of Reaper-derived design, grown rather than manufactured. Its organic components generate kinetic mass effect fields through biological processes that no conventional engineering can replicate. The weapon's internal structure self-repairs minor damage over time and its ammunition capacity far exceeds any human-built equivalent, making it a prized and deeply unsettling battlefield acquisition.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"collector-assault-rifle","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"rare"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"collector-assault-rifle","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":1000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":70,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":100,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"27d6cda170557003"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Collector Particle Beam","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Collector Particle Beam is a heavy weapon of Reaper origin that projects a sustained stream of accelerated particles capable of burning through vehicle armor. Its internal biological reservoir generates ammunition through processes no human engineer fully understands, allowing continuous fire without conventional heat sinks. When wielded against organic enemies it produces results that Cerberus researchers describe clinically as \"total thermal cascade.\" Everyone else calls it something less professional.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"collector-particle-beam","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"rare"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"collector-particle-beam","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":3000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"bomb","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":3,"die":"d6","damageType":"fire","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":80,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":50,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"dbffce65f6fba064"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Collector Sniper Rifle","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/4/40/ME3_Collector_Sniper_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Collector Sniper Rifle projects a sustained beam of superheated particle energy rather than discrete kinetic rounds. Recovered from Collector casualties during the Suicide Mission, its biological ammunition reservoir requires no conventional heat sinks. The beam burns through barriers and scorches everything behind them, delivering incendiary damage at extreme range with a precision that implies the weapon was designed to assassinate specific targets rather than engage formations.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"collector-sniper-rifle","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","volley-30"],"rarity":"rare"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"collector-sniper-rifle","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":1000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d10","damageType":"fire","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":150,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":15,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"b66bec053e2fd144"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Geth Plasma Shotgun","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/b/b9/ME3_Geth_Plasma_Shotgun.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Geth Plasma Shotgun charges a sphere of superheated plasma before releasing it in a wide burst of scorching fire. Unlike kinetic scatter weapons, its plasma dispersal can penetrate barrier fields before detonating against the target beneath. The charge time between shots is longer than conventional shotguns, but the incendiary devastation it delivers makes the wait worthwhile.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"geth-plasma-shotgun","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"geth-plasma-shotgun","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":300}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"shotgun","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"fire","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":40,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":8,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"9752397dee69692f"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Geth Pulse Rifle","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/4/4a/ME2_AR_-_Geth_Pulse_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Geth Pulse Rifle fires streams of superheated plasma slugs generated by an internal mass effect field accelerator. Unlike conventional kinetic weapons, it delivers electricity-based damage that arcs unpredictably on impact and proves particularly effective against shielded targets. Recovered units require adaptation for organic use but reward the effort with exceptional range and fire rate.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"geth-pulse-rifle","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"geth-pulse-rifle","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":300}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"electricity","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":80,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":150,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"4e9bc2a5ad9fade2"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-100 Grenade Launcher","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/f/f0/ME2_HW_-_Grenade_Launcher.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-100 Grenade Launcher fires mass effect-accelerated explosive rounds that detonate on impact, scattering kinetic fragments across a wide area. Its six-round capacity makes it one of the most sustained area-denial weapons available to infantry. Alliance heavy weapons teams use it to flush entrenched enemies from cover positions where direct fire would take too long. The concussive blast is as useful for disruption as it is for casualties.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-100-grenade-launcher","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-100-grenade-launcher","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"bomb","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"bludgeoning","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":40,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":6,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"70f0a67d291e1427"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-12 Locust","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/d/d0/ME2_SMG_-_Locust.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Developed by Kassa Fabrication for Shadow Broker operatives, the M-12 Locust bridges the gap between submachine gun and assault rifle. Heavier than standard SMGs but still manageable one-handed, it fires a larger round than its competitors with enough precision to engage targets at significantly greater range. Intelligence operatives who expect contact in confined environments but cannot afford to be caught with a full-sized rifle favor the Locust as their primary weapon.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-12-locust","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-12-locust","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":40,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":50,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"f1c1b37a2ad4e8a0"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-15 Vindicator","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/7/75/ME2_AR_-_Vindicator.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-15 Vindicator is a high-end battle rifle favored by mercenaries and private military contractors throughout the Terminus Systems. Its precision burst-fire mechanism channels kinetic rounds with exceptional accuracy at medium range, striking a balance between stopping power and controlled fire discipline that the Avenger sacrifices for capacity.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-15-vindicator","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","burst-fire"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"baseItem":"m-15-vindicator","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":80,"expend":3,"ammo":{"capacity":60,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"5b5a838cf0f2266c"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-23 Eviscerator","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/3/34/ME2_SG_-_Eviscerator.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-23 Eviscerator fires razor-edged ceramic frags that shred organic matter with brutal efficiency. Produced by Hahne-Kedar for police and security markets, its jagged scatter pattern is specifically designed to maximize tissue damage in close-quarters engagements. Alliance command has expressed concerns about the weapon's use against prisoners of war — a complaint largely ignored by those carrying it.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-23-eviscerator","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"baseItem":"m-23-eviscerator","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"shotgun","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":15,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":6,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"6c515df2ce8a709d"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-27 Scimitar","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/7/73/ME2_SG_-_Scimitar.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-27 Scimitar is an entry-level combat shotgun designed for rapid room-clearing engagements. Its lightweight construction and generous heat sink capacity allow it to cycle faster than most competitors in its class, trading raw stopping power per shot for a higher volume of scatter fire. A common choice for soldiers who prefer to keep enemies off balance rather than down in a single blast.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-27-scimitar","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"baseItem":"m-27-scimitar","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":30}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"shotgun","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":15,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":12,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"commercial","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"73f705284191a251"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-29 Incisor","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/3/34/ME2_SR_-_Incisor.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-29 Incisor fires three-round bursts synchronized to fire simultaneously, sending a tight cluster of kinetic rounds down range with each trigger pull. The result is devastating at any range the scope can reach: all three rounds arrive before a target's kinetic barrier can begin cycling against the first hit. Alliance Special Forces units favor it precisely for this reason — a single squeeze can strip a shield and land all follow-through damage in one instant.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-29-incisor","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","burst-fire","volley-30"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"m-29-incisor","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":3,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":150,"expend":3,"ammo":{"capacity":25,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"ac8d7c45c062c3f2"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-3 Predator","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/2/20/ME2_HP_-_Predator.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-3 Predator is the most common sidearm in Systems Alliance service, carried as a backup weapon by the majority of Alliance personnel. Lightweight, reliable, and requiring minimal maintenance, it offers adequate stopping power for close-range threats. In the hands of an experienced soldier, its fifteen-round heat sink provides plenty of opportunity to resolve a situation that a primary weapon couldn't finish.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-3-predator","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"baseItem":"m-3-predator","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":20}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":40,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":15,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"commercial","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"73b9302ac8c5ef66"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-300 Claymore","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/5/5a/ME2_SG_-_Claymore.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-300 Claymore is the most powerful shotgun available to ground troops in Cerberus's arsenal. A single-shot weapon of staggering lethality, it fires a dense kinetic slug capable of piercing vehicle-grade armor at point-blank range. The recoil is severe enough to require Krogan physiology or specialized shock-absorbing harnesses — for everyone else, it is a weapon of last resort and absolute commitment.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-300-claymore","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5","fatal-d12","kickback"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"m-300-claymore","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"shotgun","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":3,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":10,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":1,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"bb7d8e7ea2d13572"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-4 Shuriken","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/4/46/ME2_SMG_-_Shuriken.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-4 Shuriken is a compact submachine gun that fires three-round bursts in rapid succession. Its lightweight frame makes it easy to carry and deploy in confined spaces, though its individual round impact is modest. Mercenaries and gangsters throughout the Terminus Systems favor it for intimidation as much as combat — the distinctive chattering burst is unmistakable and tends to make opponents reconsider their position.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-4-shuriken","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"baseItem":"m-4-shuriken","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":20}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d4","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":30,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":48,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"commercial","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"5fe02675d71c44fc"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-451 Firestorm","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/d/d6/ME2_HW_-_Firestorm.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-451 Firestorm projects a sustained stream of superheated incendiary gel across a short range cone. Originally designed for burning through bulkheads in derelict station salvage operations, it was repurposed as a combat weapon when salvagers discovered its effectiveness against Husks and other Reaper-derived infantry. The fuel tank limits engagement duration, but within those constraints it is capable of clearing a room faster than any conventional weapon.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-451-firestorm","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-451-firestorm","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"bomb","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"fire","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":20,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":100,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"e8e876d419054a4e"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-490 Blackstorm","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/e/ee/ME2_HW_-_Blackstorm.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-490 Blackstorm — colloquially called the Singularity Launcher — generates a localized mass effect field that compresses into a sphere of extreme gravitational distortion. Enemies caught within its radius are crushed by the collapsing field, then flung outward when it releases. The weapon requires several seconds to charge between shots and the force damage it deals ignores conventional kinetic barriers, punishing targets that rely on them entirely.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-490-blackstorm","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","unwieldy"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"m-490-blackstorm","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":2500}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"bomb","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":4,"die":"d8","damageType":"force","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":20,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":5,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"2"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"c813f71d4609e93c"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-5 Phalanx","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/a/ae/ME3_Phalanx_Heavy_Pistol.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-5 Phalanx is a mid-range combat pistol developed for operatives who must engage threats too distant for a standard sidearm. Its integrated laser targeting system reduces aim drift, allowing accurate fire at distances most pistols cannot reliably reach. A favorite of Spectres and special operations personnel who need a one-handed weapon that punches above its weight class.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-5-phalanx","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-5-phalanx","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":50,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":12,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"418ec60030288202"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-6 Carnifex","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/0/04/ME2_HP_-_Carnifex.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-6 Carnifex is a heavy combat pistol that delivers assault-rifle stopping power in a one-handed platform. Its oversized kinetic coils accelerate dense tungsten rounds with considerable force, and the recoil requires a firm grip to manage. Favored by soldiers who trust a single devastating shot over a hail of lighter rounds, the Carnifex earns its name at close range.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-6-carnifex","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","kickback"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"m-6-carnifex","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":40,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":8,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"ec61a533e863ebeb"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-622 Avalanche","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-622 Avalanche fires cryogenic containment pods that detonate on contact, flash-freezing everything within the blast radius. Targets that survive the initial cold damage are slowed dramatically as their kinetic barriers and armor systems seize in the sudden temperature drop. Originally developed for crowd control in dangerous environments, it has since proven devastatingly effective against organic and synthetic targets alike.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-622-avalanche","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"m-622-avalanche","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"bomb","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"cold","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":30,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":8,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"76ee85fdf83a90c9"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-76 Revenant","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/3/35/ME2_AR_-_Revenant.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-76 Revenant is a heavy machine gun designed to provide overwhelming suppressive fire. Its enormous heat sink capacity enables sustained bursts that shred through enemy cover and armor alike. The weapon's considerable mass and recoil make precise movement difficult while firing, but its sheer volume of fire compensates with devastating effect.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-76-revenant","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic","unwieldy"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"m-76-revenant","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":50,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":200,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"7f648c8da806beda"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-8 Avenger","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/f/f7/ME2_AR_-_Avenger.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-8 Avenger is the standard-issue assault rifle of the Systems Alliance military. Reliable, accurate, and easy to maintain, it serves as the backbone of Alliance infantry engagements across the galaxy. Its moderate fire rate and solid kinetic impact make it a dependable choice for soldiers of any experience level.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-8-avenger","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"baseItem":"m-8-avenger","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":30}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d4","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":60,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":100,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"commercial","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"945f1a18045005c7"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-9 Tempest","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/c/ca/ME2_SMG_-_Tempest.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-9 Tempest is an Alliance-issue submachine gun optimized for the highest sustained fire rate of any one-handed weapon in service. Its enormous heat sink holds one hundred rounds that it can expend in seconds, filling a volume with kinetic fire that makes individual accuracy less critical than statistical certainty. The Tempest is light enough that experienced users can sprint and fire simultaneously without significant penalty.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-9-tempest","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic","agile"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"baseItem":"m-9-tempest","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d4","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":30,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":100,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"2f2201ed226e0516"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-92 Mantis","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/b/bf/ME2_SR_-_Mantis.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-92 Mantis is a bolt-action sniper rifle chambered for the heaviest kinetic rounds that a single operator can carry. Each shot must be manually cycled, limiting rate of fire while ensuring maximum acceleration of the projectile down the barrel. At extreme range, the Mantis punches through cover and armor with equal contempt. A standard-issue precision weapon for Alliance snipers who prefer certainty over speed.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-92-mantis","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","fatal-d10","kickback","volley-30"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"baseItem":"m-92-mantis","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":30}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d10","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":120,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":1,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"commercial","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"b30b65e1b072de56"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-920 Cain","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/b/bf/ME3_Cain_Heavy_Weapon.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-920 Cain is a man-portable nuclear weapon. It fires a microscale nuclear warhead that detonates in a thermobaric burst capable of vaporizing anything within the blast radius and incinerating everything on its periphery. Alliance High Command classifies its use under battlefield nuclear doctrine despite the manufacturer's insistence that the yield technically falls below treaty thresholds. Anyone who has seen what it does to a Geth armature disagrees.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-920-cain","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","kickback","unwieldy"],"rarity":"rare"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":11},"baseItem":"m-920-cain","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":5000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"advanced","group":"bomb","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":8,"die":"d8","damageType":"fire","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":50,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":1,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"2"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"94d9efc1986a98ac"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-96 Mattock","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/9/93/ME3_Mattock_Assault_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-96 Mattock is a hybrid weapon bridging the gap between assault rifle and sniper rifle. Its semi-automatic fire mechanism delivers high-impact rounds with precision that fully automatic platforms cannot match. Demanding of the user's discipline, the Mattock rewards careful aim with exceptional damage output and minimal recoil per shot.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-96-mattock","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","kickback"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-96-mattock","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":80,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":16,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"37368574c0f66326"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-97 Viper","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/f/f2/ME2_SR_-_Viper.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-97 Viper is a semi-automatic sniper rifle built for sustained precision fire. Where bolt-action rifles demand patience between shots, the Viper allows follow-up strikes without breaking scope alignment. Its heat sink holds twelve rounds before requiring a swap, enabling snipers to handle multiple targets at range without repositioning. The trade-off is a somewhat lighter kinetic impact per shot compared to the Mantis.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-97-viper","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","volley-30"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"baseItem":"m-97-viper","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d10","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":120,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":12,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"8f027022f816367f"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-98 Widow","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/b/b9/ME2_SR_-_Widow.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-98 Widow is an anti-materiel rifle designed to destroy vehicles, not people — its use against personnel is technically prohibited by several Citadel treaties. Its single-round heat sink fires a kinetic slug at velocities sufficient to punch through the lightest starship hull plating at close range. The recoil is violent enough to shatter bones in unaugmented users. Those capable of wielding it treat it as a statement as much as a weapon.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-98-widow","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","fatal-d12","kickback","unwieldy","volley-30"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"m-98-widow","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":4,"die":"d10","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":200,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":1,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"1ec1cac638fe06fe"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Arc Pistol","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/e/e8/ME3_Arc_Heavy_Pistol.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Arc Pistol fires a bolt of concentrated electromagnetic energy that can be charged for a more powerful shot at the cost of a brief delay. Standard fire delivers rapid electrical strikes against shielded targets; a charged shot releases a focused arc that tears through barrier fields and delivers a massive voltage spike to whatever is behind them. Quarian engineers originally developed it for hull cutting work; its adoption as a combat sidearm was an obvious next step.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"arc-pistol","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"arc-pistol","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d8","damageType":"electricity","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":40,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":25,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"cabd382d67b87ac7"}
{"folder":null,"name":"AT-12 Raider","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/3/3f/ME3_Raider_Shotgun.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The AT-12 Raider is a compact shotgun favored by Cerberus assault troopers for its reliability and ease of use in close-quarters combat. Its dual-fire mechanism releases two shells per trigger pull in rapid succession, trading ammunition efficiency for a burst of kinetic scatter that overwhelms point-defense systems before they can cycle. Fast, aggressive, and designed for attackers who intend to win the first second of an engagement.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"at-12-raider","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"baseItem":"at-12-raider","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"shotgun","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":15,"expend":2,"ammo":{"capacity":12,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"b27599d823c1d514"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Black Widow","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/4/44/ME3_Black_Widow_Sniper_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Black Widow is a semi-automatic refinement of the M-98 Widow, trading a fraction of its predecessor's per-shot devastation for a three-round heat sink that allows follow-up shots without a full heat sink swap. It retains the Widow's anti-materiel velocity and its ability to end most living things with a single correctly placed round — the added capacity simply means a miss need not be fatal to the shooter.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"black-widow","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","fatal-d12","kickback","volley-30"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":11},"baseItem":"black-widow","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":5000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":3,"die":"d10","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":200,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":3,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"fe85ba6a776412ac"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Blood Pack Punisher","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/1/17/ME3_Blood_Pack_Punisher_Smg.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Blood Pack Punisher is a dual-barrel submachine gun engineered by Vorcha gunsmiths for the Blood Pack mercenary company. Its secondary barrel fires a stream of pellets simultaneously with the primary, effectively doubling the volume of fire at the cost of ammunition consumption. The design prioritizes offensive aggression over defensive discipline, which suits Blood Pack doctrine perfectly — they rarely needed a weapon that rewards patience.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"blood-pack-punisher","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"blood-pack-punisher","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":30,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":100,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"a72616c506a0368d"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Disciple","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/6/6a/ME3_Disciple_Shotgun.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Disciple is a lightweight Quarian-designed shotgun built for use in confined ship corridors where a full-sized combat shotgun would be unwieldy. It fires a wide scatter pattern at low weight cost, making it popular among crew members who need close-range stopping power without sacrificing mobility. Its modest round-per-round damage is compensated by its rapid cycling and the simply overwhelming number of pellets it puts into a small area.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"disciple","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"baseItem":"disciple","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"shotgun","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":15,"expend":2,"ammo":{"capacity":20,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"e25d68d5b755714f"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Geth Spitfire","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/1/1d/ME3_Geth_Spitfire_Heavy_Weapon.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Geth Spitfire is a heavy infantry weapon fielded by Geth Primes during the Reaper War, offering the sustained fire rate of a machine gun with the stopping power of a heavy weapon. Its enormous heat sink capacity sustains two hundred and fifty rounds of high-velocity kinetic fire without interruption. The weapon was designed for Geth platforms that do not fatigue; organic users who attempt to match that fire discipline typically find their arms giving out before the heat sink does.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"geth-spitfire","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic","unwieldy"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"geth-spitfire","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":50,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":250,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"b70bb05deb6f5d60"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Javelin","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/7/7b/ME3_Javelin_Sniper_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Javelin is a Cerberus electromagnetic sniper rifle that charges and fires a bolt of arc energy capable of penetrating solid cover before detonating against the target on the other side. Enemies hidden behind walls, crates, or wreckage offer no protection against it — the bolt passes through non-conductive barriers entirely. Against shielded and synthetic targets the electrical devastation is unparalleled, and at maximum range its arc expands to catch clustered enemies in the discharge.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"javelin","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","fatal-d12","volley-30"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"javelin","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":3,"die":"d8","damageType":"electricity","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":200,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":3,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"0730d1dabc8ed4e8"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Kishock Harpoon Gun","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/d/db/ME3_Kishock_Harpoon_Gun.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Kishock is a Batarian harpoon gun that fires a mass-accelerated barbed spike at extreme velocity. Originally designed for hunting the armored fauna of Khar'shan's southern continent, it translates to combat with lethal efficiency. The harpoon penetrates kinetic barriers and embeds in the target rather than passing through, ensuring the full kinetic transfer occurs internally. Against unarmored targets the results are immediate and final; against armored ones, the penetration capabilities still prove decisive.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"kishock-harpoon-gun","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","fatal-d12","volley-30"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"kishock-harpoon-gun","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":150,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":1,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"36f6f50630759c8c"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-11 Suppressor","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/8/84/ME3_Suppressor.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-11 Suppressor is a lightweight combat pistol designed for operatives who need a reliable sidearm without the bulk and noise signature of heavier options. Its kinetic dampeners reduce acoustic discharge to levels below ambient station noise, making it genuinely difficult to locate by sound alone. Cerberus intelligence operatives and Shadow Broker agents carry it for exactly that reason — in environments where gunfire draws attention, the Suppressor keeps options available.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-11-suppressor","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-11-suppressor","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":3,"die":"d4","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":40,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":12,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null},"subitems":[{"_id":"5fa4e7c8872165e0","name":"Silencer (Commercial)","type":"equipment","effects":[],"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/consumables/other-consumables/silencer.webp","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e-anachronism.equipment.Item.nPmeqjZ8b0mjqSfs","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A cylinder is filled with internal sound baffles to reduce noise. The weapon doesn't make a loud noise when fired. However, creatures hit by the ammunition might still cry out in pain.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"silencer-commercial","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Starfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":0},"quantity":1,"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"sp":10}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"containerId":null,"size":"med","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unusual Object","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/adventuring_gear.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"usage":{"value":"installed-in-ranged-weapon-without-a-loudener"},"subitems":[]}}]},"_id":"615e71d6597891f3"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-11 Wraith","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/4/45/ME3_Wraith_Shotgun.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-11 Wraith is a single-shot combat shotgun that sacrifices fire rate for kinetic devastation. Each round must be manually cycled, but the single shell it chambers carries enough mass-accelerated shot to drop a Phantom through their kinetic barrier in one blast. Originally designed for breach-and-clear operations, Cerberus tacticians found its two-shell capacity insufficient for sustained combat — the operatives using it countered that if two shots aren't enough, the problem was aim, not capacity.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-11-wraith","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5","fatal-d10","kickback"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-11-wraith","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"shotgun","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":15,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":2,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"d72ce93b0c70b4f1"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-25 Hornet","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/6/66/ME3_Hornet_Smg.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-25 Hornet is a compact submachine gun originally developed for Terminus mercenary groups operating in tight urban environments. Its automatic fire delivers a consistent stream of kinetic rounds with enough velocity to defeat light armor, while its single-hand operation leaves the other free for biotics, tech abilities, or cover manipulation. Cerberus assault troopers adopted it during the Reaper War, where its combination of compactness and sustained fire rate proved well-suited to rapid breach operations.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-25-hornet","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"baseItem":"m-25-hornet","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":35,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":60,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"02607fb6608aa43c"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-358 Talon","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/9/99/ME3_Talon_Heavy_Pistol.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-358 Talon is a heavy pistol that fires two explosive rounds simultaneously, converting the conventional pistol format into a point-blank scatter weapon. The paired detonations punch through kinetic barriers and spread shrapnel across a wide arc, making precise aim less critical than pointing it in the right direction. Mercenaries who operate in close-quarters corridors favor it for exactly that forgiving quality — in a tight space, the Talon rarely misses anything.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-358-talon","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-358-talon","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d4","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":15,"expend":2,"ammo":{"capacity":12,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"f6a8cabc9c7ed56d"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-55 Argus","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/9/95/ME3_Argus_Assault_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-55 Argus is a battle rifle that fires three-round bursts with enough force to stagger heavily armored targets. Alliance R&amp;D designed it to bridge the gap between the Avenger's volume of fire and the Mattock's raw stopping power. Its burst pattern keeps shots tightly grouped at medium range, and the combination of mass and velocity makes each cluster capable of punching through armor that individual rounds would merely dent.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-55-argus","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","burst-fire"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-55-argus","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":70,"expend":3,"ammo":{"capacity":40,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"32ddd464f8e1e462"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-7 Lancer","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/c/c6/ME3_Lancer_AS.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-7 Lancer is a legendary assault rifle from the First Contact War era, restored and reissued during the Reaper War when conventional ammunition supplies became unreliable. Unlike modern mass effect weapons, it draws power directly from its user's suit capacitors rather than consuming heat sink clips. Its internal power cell theoretically never runs dry as long as the wearer's kinetic barrier system is active, making it one of the few weapons that performs better the longer a firefight lasts.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-7-lancer","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"m-7-lancer","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"electricity","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":70,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":200,"baseType":"battery","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"c78b7f93cefa918b"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-77 Paladin","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/4/43/ME3_Paladin_Heavy_Pistol.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-77 Paladin is the heaviest combat pistol available to Alliance operatives, firing anti-armor rounds at velocities that blur the line between handgun and carbine. Its six-round heat sink fires slowly but with authority — each shot delivers enough kinetic force to stagger armored infantry and penetrate the lighter plating of Cerberus combat drones outright. Those who need a pistol that respects no armor class carry the Paladin.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-77-paladin","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","kickback"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"m-77-paladin","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":50,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":6,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"a89c1aa4260495c4"}
{"folder":null,"name":"M-90 Indra","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/b/b6/ME3_Indra_Sniper_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The M-90 Indra is the only fully automatic sniper rifle in standard production, a design compromise that sacrifices per-shot stopping power to give snipers the ability to engage multiple targets without repositioning. Its twenty-round heat sink allows sustained precision fire at extreme range, making it particularly effective against lightly armored enemies that conventional snipers would waste a full-cycle reload on. Unusual enough in principle to be genuinely surprising in action.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"m-90-indra","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic","volley-30"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"baseItem":"m-90-indra","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":250}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":120,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":20,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"efe3ca89da6555df"}
{"folder":null,"name":"N7 Crusader","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/3/3a/ME3_N7_Crusader_Shotgun.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The N7 Crusader is a precision combat shotgun designed for N7 operatives who must engage heavily armored targets in confined environments where a sniper rifle is impractical. Its single large-bore round does not scatter — it penetrates. The kinetic payload is sufficient to punch through heavy armor, and at the ranges where a shotgun is fired, there is nowhere to dodge. Slow to cycle but absolutely decisive when it connects.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"n7-crusader","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","fatal-d12","kickback"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"n7-crusader","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"shotgun","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":25,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":4,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"ea8a8b33f2b8de50"}
{"folder":null,"name":"N7 Eagle","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/0/01/ME3_N7_Eagle_Heavy_Pistol.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The N7 Eagle is a fully automatic heavy pistol engineered for operatives who need the mobility of a one-handed weapon without sacrificing fire rate. Its enlarged kinetic coil assembly cycles rounds faster than any other pistol in production, delivering suppressive fire volumes that rival light submachine guns while maintaining the handling profile of a standard sidearm. For N7 operatives who refuse to be outgunned regardless of what weapon hand they have free, the Eagle is the answer.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"n7-eagle","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":11},"baseItem":"n7-eagle","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":5000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":30,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":30,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"545ee2e7eb954ecc"}
{"folder":null,"name":"N7 Hurricane","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/e/e9/ME3_N7_Hurricane_Smg.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The N7 Hurricane is the premier submachine gun in Alliance service, developed specifically for N7 operatives who require sustained fire at the upper limits of what SMG kinetics can deliver. Its enlarged heat sink holds seventy-five rounds and its oversized coil assembly fires them with enough force to threaten light armor — a capability few weapons in this size class can claim. The weapon requires two hands to manage effectively at its peak fire rate, but the volume of fire it produces has ended more than a few engagements before the enemy could mount a counter.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"n7-hurricane","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"n7-hurricane","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":35,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":75,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"1386a8c8c6e2c281"}
{"folder":null,"name":"N7 Saber","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/6/65/ME3_Saber_Assault_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The N7 Saber is a semi-automatic assault rifle built for N7 operatives who prioritize controlled precision over suppressive volume. Its reinforced kinetic coil assembly fires larger rounds than standard battle rifles with enough velocity to defeat medium armor at full combat range. Where the Mattock trades capacity for power, the Saber achieves both — at a price that reflects the engineering investment.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"n7-saber","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"n7-saber","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d10","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":80,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":30,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"ceaa8d4b582154bd"}
{"folder":null,"name":"N7 Typhoon","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/a/ab/ME3_Typhoon_Assault_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The N7 Typhoon is a light machine gun developed for N7 operatives who require sustained suppressive fire without fire support teams. Its three hundred round capacity allows continuous fire long past the point where conventional assault rifles would have overheated, and its oversized kinetic coils deliver heavy round impacts that can stop advancing Brutes and Atlases alike. The weapon's mass makes precise movement during sustained fire impossible, but the wall of lead it produces tends to make movement unnecessary.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"n7-typhoon","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":["auto-only"],"value":["tech","automatic","unwieldy"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":11},"baseItem":"n7-typhoon","bulk":{"value":3},"price":{"value":{"gp":5000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":8,"die":"d4","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":120,"expend":3,"ammo":{"capacity":300,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"4fcb3ce3e6748f56"}
{"folder":null,"name":"N7 Valiant","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/1/14/ME3_N7_Valiant_Sniper_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The N7 Valiant is a semi-automatic precision rifle developed for N7 special operations snipers who must engage hardened targets across multiple shots without the vulnerability of a bolt-action reload. Its five-round heat sink allows rapid follow-up fire while maintaining the kinetic impact necessary to defeat heavy armor. Between the Widow's devastating single shot and the Viper's rapid volume, the Valiant occupies the premium tier for operators who need both.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"n7-valiant","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","volley-30"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":9},"baseItem":"n7-valiant","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":2000}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"sniper","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d10","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":180,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":5,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"superior","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"d08da20b053afd9e"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Phaeston","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/1/11/ME3_Phaeston_Assault_Rifle.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Phaeston is a Turian assault rifle designed around their military doctrine of precision automatic fire. Its recoil dampeners and balanced weight distribution allow full-auto fire without significant barrel climb, making it more accurate in sustained bursts than most human-designed equivalents. Alliance soldiers who get their hands on one rarely give it back willingly.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"phaeston","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","automatic"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"baseItem":"phaeston","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":100}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"rifle","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d8","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":70,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":60,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"tactical","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"6c21c118376e6890"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Scorpion","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/4/40/ME3_Scorpion_Heavy_Pistol.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Scorpion is a pistol that fires sticky explosive rounds that attach to their target before detonating a moment after impact. Enemies who survive the initial hit are forced to choose between standing still while the charge detonates or moving to let it blow — neither is a good option. The blast radius and concussive force makes it particularly effective against clustered infantry who can't scatter before the detonation chain catches them all.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"scorpion","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"scorpion","bulk":{"value":1},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":"pistol","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d6","damageType":"bludgeoning","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":20,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":10,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"0"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"631ffa50b59a0051"}
{"folder":null,"name":"Venom Shotgun","type":"weapon","effects":[],"img":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/masseffect/images/7/76/ME3_Venom_Shotgun.png","flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.12.2","lastModifiedBy":null},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The Venom Shotgun is a Cerberus-developed weapon that fires charged explosive rounds rather than conventional scatter shot. The rounds detonate on impact in a concussive blast that knocks enemies off their feet regardless of their armor rating. Users who miss a direct hit still benefit from the blast radius. With only five rounds before requiring a heat sink swap, each shot must count — but the Venom rewards the patience to make them do exactly that.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"venom-shotgun","_migration":{"version":0.955,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["tech","scatter-5"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Mass Effect Homebrew","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"baseItem":"venom-shotgun","bulk":{"value":2},"price":{"value":{"gp":700}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"category":"martial","group":"shotgun","bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":2,"die":"d8","damageType":"bludgeoning","persistent":null},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":15,"expend":1,"ammo":{"capacity":5,"baseType":"projectile-ammo","builtIn":false},"reload":{"value":"1"},"grade":"advanced","runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null}},"_id":"977eed27c2fd6506"}
